<title>JAPAN: Komai Tekko - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Komai Tekko - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 19.52		vs	   19.91</p>
<p> Operating	  742    million	  vs	  575    million</p>
